==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-au-crash course.ogg|Audio (AU)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} A [[quick]], [[intense]] course of [[learning]], especially one which is [[informal]] or [[hurried]].
#: ''He got a '''crash course''' in babysitting when his sister dropped off his nephew for the afternoon.''

